","README.md":"# Webhook inbox: replay-safe delivery

A billing webhook consumer already works for ordinary deliveries. Customers report duplicated credits and cross-account event collisions. Repair delivery handling while preserving arrival order.

## Release requirements

Input: account, secret, and events. Each event has account, id, signature, amount and time. Accept only matching account and signature; amount must be a safe integer. Invalid deliveries return "rejected" and must not consume an ID. A previously accepted ID returns "duplicate". Otherwise add amount to balance and return "accepted". Start at balance 0. Return balance and results. Event IDs may be any string, including object property names. Rejected attempts can be retried with a valid payload. Do not mutate input.

## Working agreement

