","README.md":"# Private downloads: grant expiry and revocation

An existing private download gateway must support revocation. Fix the boundary bugs before enabling the new endpoint.

## Release requirements

Input: now, tenant, user, grants, revoked and requests. Each grant has token, tenant, user, path, expires and uses. Requests contain token and path. Return one boolean per request. Reject unknown/revoked tokens, mismatched tenant/user/path, now >= expires, and grants with no remaining uses. Only successful requests decrement uses. Reject a path containing a ".." segment, backslash or percent sign. Token lookup must be safe for arbitrary strings. Grant tokens are unique. Initial uses are nonnegative integers. Do not mutate the grants.

## Working agreement

