A search panel displays suggestions. Add request ownership and keyboard navigation so late responses cannot replace results for the current query.

## Release requirements

Input: actions query {value}, resolve {id,items}, move {delta}, select, clear. Initial {query:"",request:0,loading:false,items:[],focus:-1,selected:null}. Query increments request, sets query, clears results/focus/selection, loading is true iff trimmed query is nonempty. Resolve applies only for current request while loading, filters duplicate item IDs keeping first and sets loading=false,focus=-1. Move clamps focus to [0,length-1] (from -1, +1 selects index 0); no items keeps -1. Select chooses focused item ID or null. Clear behaves as empty query. Items have string id and label. Return {state,html}. Render a labeled query input, status for loading, listbox with option elements, aria-selected on the focused option, escaped labels, and Select disabled when focus=-1. Events are deterministic fixtures: no external API needed.

